==English==

===Etymology===
From [[w:Huldrych Zwingli|Huldrych Zwingli]] (1484–1531), Swiss Protestant reformer

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|-}}

# Relating or referring to [[Zwingli]], his beliefs, or his followers and adherents.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A follower of Zwingli, who disagreed with Luther in rejecting the doctrine of the presence of Christ in the Eucharist.

